{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52080","headline":"五言早秋[仪鸾殿]侍宴应诏 · 杨师道","name":"五言早秋[仪鸾殿]侍宴应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋气洒云景，高弦韵早风。\n雕梁尚飞鷰，洛浦未惊鸿。\n水泛芙蕖影，桥临芳桂丛。\n称觞奉高兴，长愿比华嵩。\n（见清末贵阳陈田影刊日本尾张国真福寺藏唐卷子本《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗原署：「中书令驸马都尉安德郡开国公臣杨师道上」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨师道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}